  <p>Write to the broker's complaints team using its official contact details. Explain the issue, attach relevant evidence, and request a complaint reference number. Keep copies of all replies.</p>

  <h3>Step 2: Check the Relevant Ombudsman</h3>
  <p>The <a href="https://www.financial-ombudsman.org.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">UK Financial Ombudsman Service</a> handles eligible complaints involving firms within its jurisdiction. The <a href="https://www.afca.org.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Australian Financial Complaints Authority</a> handles eligible Australian financial complaints. Eligibility depends on the firm, entity, and complaint.</p>

  <h3>Step 3: Check Financial Commission Membership</h3>
  <p>Some brokers' entities may belong to the <a href="https://financialcommission.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Financial Commission</a>. Check its current membership list and dispute rules. Membership and eligibility depend on the specific entity and complaint.</p>

  <h3>When a Card Chargeback May Apply</h3>
  <p>Contact your card issuer if you suspect an unauthorised payment or payment fraud. A chargeback is not a guaranteed remedy for trading losses or a disputed trading outcome.</p>

  <h3>Reporting Concerns in Pakistan</h3>
  <p>You can report suspected securities-related misconduct through the <a href="https://www.secp.gov.pk/contact-us/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SECP contact page</a>. For a complaint involving a bank or payment service, use the <a href="https://sunwai.sbp.org.pk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SBP Sunwai portal</a> where applicable. These channels cannot guarantee recovery from an offshore broker.</p>

  <h3>Check Payment Rules Before Transferring Funds</h3>
  <p>The <a href="https://www.sbp.org.pk/EPD/2022/FECL8.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SBP circular on offshore forex platforms</a> addresses payments for offshore forex, margin trading, and CFD platforms. Review the official notice and applicable rules before sending money abroad.</p>

  <h3>Keep Your Withdrawal Records</h3>
  <p>Save deposit receipts, withdrawal requests, wallet transaction records, and broker correspondence. Check the broker's withdrawal policy and any applicable original-payment-method requirements before making a deposit.</p>
