  <p class="cp-lead">Regulatory warnings, enforcement actions, and fines apply to the entities named in official records. A finding against one company does not automatically apply to every company operating under the same brand.</p>

  <p>Check the relevant regulator's records before funding an account. Search using the exact legal entity name and licence number shown in your client agreement. Regulatory records and warnings can change over time.</p>

  <h3>United Kingdom: FCA Register</h3>
