  <h3>Cyprus: CySEC</h3>
  <p>Visit the <a href="https://www.cysec.gov.cy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CySEC website</a> to find regulatory announcements, firm information, and published warnings.</p>

  <h3>Australia: ASIC</h3>
  <p>Use the <a href="https://asic.gov.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ASIC website</a> to check financial services information, enforcement actions, and investor alerts.</p>

  <h3>How to Interpret Regulatory Records</h3>
